<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria offers four floater T-bill issues May 5.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria offers four floater T-bill issues May 5.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry will offer four floater coupon T-bill issues with maturities of three, six, nine and 12 months respectively at auctions on Monday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The issues will be offered with no par values or minimum acceptable prices set in advance.</p>
<p>The coupons of the four issues equal the central bank main interest rate until maturity. The main interest rate is now set at 6.20 percent monthly or 74.40 percent annually.</p>
<p>Details of the issues follow:</p>
<p> Issue number	   BG3031397022	 BG3031497020</p>
<p> Term		     three months	 six months</p>
<p> Auction date	   May 5		  May 5</p>
<p> Issue date	     May 7		  May 7</p>
<p> Maturity date	  August 6	     November 5</p>
<p> Issue number	   BG3031597027	 BG3031697025</p>
<p> Term		     nine months	  12 months</p>
<p> Auction date	   May 5		  May 5</p>
<p> Issue date	     May 7		  May 7</p>
<p> Maturity date	  February 4, 1998   May 6, 1998</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
